"controller mode."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/boards/README.md:21
msgid ""
"Start with an exact part and a small reviewed route set, then follow the "
"[Board porting guide](/guides/board-porting.md). A syntactically valid JSON "
"file does not establish fitted components, connector continuity, power "
"supply or physical timing. Uninspected PCB revisions and jumpers remain "
"unknown; software fixtures do not qualify a real PCB. MCU physical HIL "
"remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"Start with an exact part and a small reviewed route set, then follow the "
